Hi @terranboy,

The routing example doesn't demonstrate what you are trying to achieve currently. It's up to you to decide how you want the `searchState` to be transformed as an url.

What you could add is a clean up function that will remove any empty objects and any empty strings from the `searchState`.

Ex:

```js
import {omitBy, toPairs, isEmpty, isObject} from 'lodash';

const searchState = toPairs(nextSearchState).reduce((acc, pair) => {
      const value = isObject(pair[1]) ? omitBy(pair[1], v => v === '') : pair[1];
      if (value !== '' && !isEmpty(value)) {
        acc[pair[0]] = value;
      }
      return acc;
    }, {});
```

Let me know if this help.
